From: Sasha Levin <sashal@kernel.org>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 14:07:29 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "drm/amd/display: Add missing kdoc for ALLM
 parameters"
References: bsc#1012628
Patch-mainline: 7.1.6
Git-commit: 749a36657ca236994218210e6b5f30d05792b232

This reverts commit 994a42b890cef46cd576a3bf700f1dbd6bb21346.

Signed-off-by: Sasha Levin <sashal@kernel.org>
Signed-off-by: Jiri Slaby <jslaby@suse.cz>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/modules/info_packet/info_packet.c | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/modules/info_packet/info_packet.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/modules/info_packet/info_packet.c
index 614db22d62f3..00473c6284d5 100644
